{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46815","headline":"谢人惠十色花牋幷棋子 · 齐己","name":"谢人惠十色花牋幷棋子","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"陵州棋子浣花牋，深愧携来自锦州。\n海蚌琢成星落落，吴绫隐出雁翩翩。\n留防桂苑题诗客，惜寄桃源敌手仙。\n捧受不堪思出处，七千余里劒门前。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"齐己","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_46815.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46815","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}